  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB07310",
    "sub_id": "65804",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>(1) Quiz : 50% (成績包含:上課出席率、上課與老師問答的參與度、數次課堂小考、各章節的課堂簡報資料和上台報告的台風及表達理解程度) (2) Midterm exam: 25% (3) Final project: 25%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>(1) Quiz : 50% (Scores include: attendance rate, participation in class questions and answers with teachers, several classroom quizzes, classroom briefing materials for each chapter, and the level of understanding and expression of presentations on stage.)</div>\n\n<div>(2) Midterm exam and project: 25%</div>\n\n<div>(3) Final exam and project: 25%</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "所有課程活動都將在同學之間的友好參與和互動氛圍中進行，彼此間尊重和欣賞每位同學的個人經歷、背景和觀點，如國內外各學制、多元入學及學習文化、性別等。希望您始終在本課程中應用最高的學術標準，並以有尊嚴和尊重的態度對待同學。",
    "course_pol_en": "All course activities will be carried out in an atmosphere of friendly participation and interaction among students, respecting and appreciating each student's personal experience, background and perspectives, such as various school systems at home and abroad, diverse enrollment and learning cultures, gender, etc. You are expected to apply the highest academic standards throughout this course and to treat fellow students with dignity and respect.",
    "course_rem": "多樣化、公平和包容性聲明 我的教學設計，要讓來自不同背景和觀點的學生都能從這門課程中獲得很好的學習，學生的學習需求能得到解決，學生帶給這門課的多樣性可以經舉手、邀請您合適地表達出來，並被視為一種資源、力量並惠及所有學生。如有任何疑慮，請利用請益時間來找我。",
    "course_rem_en": "Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Statement I design my instruction so that students from different backgrounds and perspectives can learn well from the course, that the learning needs of the students are addressed, and that the diversity that students bring to the course can be met with a raise of hand, invitation You are appropriately expressed and seen as a resource, strength and benefit to all students. If you have any concerns, please take advantage of the time to come to me.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>凡是學生曲解自己的學習任務、或損害學術任務之不端正行為，包括在作業或考試中作弊、剽竊、串改；或將他人完成的作品作為自己的作品；或未經教師批准和同意，提交相同或相似的論文、報告，以滿足多門課程的要求；凡被認定有學術不端行為的學生，其學業成績將扣分，若第二次勸說不聽者，該學期成績以不及格計算，並依本校學生獎懲辦法提報處分。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Any student who misinterprets his/her own learning tasks, or misbehaves that damages academic tasks, including cheating, plagiarizing, and colluding in homework or exams; or using other people&#39;s works as their own; or submitting The same or similar papers and reports to meet the requirements of multiple courses; students who are found to have academic misconduct will have their academic grades deducted. And report for punishment in accordance with the school&#39;s student reward and punishment regulations.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
